      "independent_solution": "A valid four-period plan contains PE,English,Mathematics,Nature exactly once. Examples in period order: (PE,English,Mathematics,Nature), (English,Mathematics,Nature,PE), (Mathematics,PE,Nature,English). They are different ordered sequences even though their subject sets coincide. There are 4!=24 possible plans, although the source only asks for several, not all."
