      "independent_solution": "Successors: c10->c11,ck->c(k+1),c(k+3)->c(k+4),c(k-2)->c(k-1),c(2k)->c(2k+1). Predecessors: c50->c49,ck->c(k-1),c(k+7)->c(k+6),c(k-4)->c(k-5),c(2k+3)->c(2k+2). Add/subtract 1 from the entire index, not from each symbol. Conditions: c(k-2) requires k>=3; ck has a predecessor only for k>=2; c(k-4) requires k>=5 to exist but has a predecessor only for k>=6. Natural index 0 is not permitted. Other displayed symbolic cases are valid for k>=1."
