      "independent_solution": "Strictly increasing: b,d. Strictly decreasing: a,c. Neither: x,y. In a each successive power of 0.1 is smaller; in c reciprocal denominators increase. b grows by adding a positive decimal digit; d has adjacent difference 1/((j+1)(j+2))>0. x decreases 1->-2 then increases -2->3. y has equal adjacent terms at indices 2/3,5/6,8/9, so it is not strictly increasing despite never falling."
    },
    {
